  "description": "AWS SDK for .NET V3 is in maintenance mode as of March 1st, 2026, with only critical bugs and security issues addressed until end of support on June 1st, 2026. See https://docs.aws.amazon.com/sdk-for-net/v4/developer-guide/net-dg-v4.html for migration guidance. Cloud Directory (CD) is a multi-tenant, hierarchical data store for use by other AWS services to store directory data for AWS resources, including both metadata about resources and policy data governing resources.",
